 **Parameters:**
 *   **Isovalue ($\tau$):** The scalar value defining the surface. Typical values depend on the normalization of $f_\theta$ [S1].
-*   **Grid Resolution:** Determines the granularity of the Marching Cubes triangulation. Higher resolution yields smoother surfaces but increases the number of potential singularities and sampling candidates [S1].
